    "sub_name": "纖維系統成形工程(一)",
    "sub_ename": "FIBER SYSTEMS FORMING ENGINEERING (1)",
    "describe_ch": "介紹纖維織物成型之原理及織造工程中主、副與輔助運動之原理。使學習者具備有纖維織物製造之理論基礎，並啟發學習者研究與開發的能力。",
    "describe_eh": "To introduce principles of fiber woven fabrics formation and their primary, secondary and auxiliary motions principle. To acquire an understanding of the basic theory, and to instruct the research and development ability of the learner.",
